# Ghost Hive Constitution — SPEC v2

[`SPEC.md`](SPEC.md) v1.7.3 = frozen MVP-Archiv. [`SPEC-v1.md`](SPEC-v1.md) = Watch-v1-Archiv. **Live:** [`SPEC-v2.md`](SPEC-v2.md).

## MUST

- Implement named v2 items only when Noah orders code. Until then, running tree may still be v1 Watch + 1.7.3 kernel.
- On technical decisions: SPEC-v2 first, then SPEC-v1 for UI chrome not overridden, then SPEC.md bits.
- Watch remains display in `terminal_mode`. Telemetry never Down/Kill/Alert (P16 LogOnly).
- Stay local. RAM ≤ 24 MB. Root ciphertext. TETACT not a PSP module. HMAC-I never Down. EBOOT arming locked.

## MUST NOT

- Add modules, states, capabilities, or extra Event types beyond `TelemetryUpdate`.
- Add policies beyond P16.
- Auto-enroll from telemetry. Mines/NAS/Kernel MUST NOT send TelemetryUpdate.
- Invent peer metrics; Absent sentinel → `--`.
- Use UDP opcode 0x42 as Event.type (magic is payload[0] only).
- Honeypot, `ghost_config.json`, XMB launcher, Watch lock.

